#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom &amp; Magnifier"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Zoom and Magnifier tools in KDE Plasma are designed to enlarge portions "
"of the screen, serving as a digital magnifying glass. While they share the "
"goal of making small text and fine details more legible, they offer two "
"distinct ways of interacting with the desktop environment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "There are the two sections <guilabel>Sticky Keys</guilabel> and "
#| "<guilabel>Locking Keys</guilabel> to this panel."
msgid ""
"Here you can switch between the <guilabel>Full screen</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Magnify region</guilabel> modes."
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् पटलस्य <guilabel>Sticky Keys</guilabel> तथा <guilabel>Locking Keys</"
"guilabel> इति विभागद्वयम् अस्ति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Full screen"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable fullscreen mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show pixel grid at zoom level"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provide a visual overlay of the individual pixels that make up the image on "
"your screen once you have reached a high enough magnification. If enabled, "
"&plasma; draws a thin grid around every single pixel so you can see exactly "
"where one ends and the next begins."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:90
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Pointer acceleration"
msgid "Pointer appearance"
msgstr "सूचकत्वरणम्"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Controls the mouse pointer appearance when zooming. There are several "
"options: <guilabel>Scale</guilabel>, <guilabel>Keep</guilabel>, and "
"<guilabel>Hide</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:97
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Pointer acceleration"
msgid "Pointer tracking"
msgstr "सूचकत्वरणम्"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Proportional"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom area moves in sync with pointer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centered"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer stays centered on-screen, except near screen edges."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centered (Strict)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer stays centered on-screen, even near screen edges."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Push"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer pushes zoom area at screen edges."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:134 index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom area does not follow pointer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharpen screen content while zoomed in"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If turned on, &kwin; will use pattern recognition to try to scale the shape "
"of text/icons on the workspace at extreme zoom levels. This would help "
"improve overall text contrast at the cost of font accuracy by avoiding blur "
"or pixelation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable focus tracking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ensures the magnified viewport automatically follows the <quote>active</"
"quote> part of the interface, even if your mouse is not moving. While "
"standard zoom usually follows the mouse cursor, focus tracking monitors the "
"system focus (the text cursor or the currently selected UI element)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable text caret tracking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows the system's magnification tools to follow the text cursor rather "
"than just the mouse pointer. In technical environments—whether you are "
"writing code, drafting a research manuscript, or filling out complex forms—"
"your focus is often where you are typing, which may be far away from where "
"your mouse is resting."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Magnify region"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable the region magnification mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows to configure the width of the magnified area."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows to configure the height of the magnified area."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disable the scaling modes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom factor"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adjusts how much the screen enlarges with each step (&eg;, 1.2x or 2.0x). "
"&plasma; supports extreme magnification levels (up to 100x), which is "
"significantly higher than most other operating systems."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scroll gesture modifier keys"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to perform scrolling actions using a combination of a keyboard "
"key and mouse movement, rather than using a physical scroll wheel."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is particularly useful for users who use trackballs, specialized "
"pointing devices without wheels, or who have motor impairments that make "
"using a scroll wheel difficult."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zoom scroll gestures are only available on Wayland."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scroll while modifier keys are pressed to zoom"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option enabled, holding down a specific key (usually the &Meta; "
"key) and rotating your mouse wheel (or using a two-finger scroll on a "
"touchpad) will dynamically increase or decrease the magnification of the "
"entire desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Shortcuts…"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use shortcuts to control zoom."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "System Bell"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This panel is divided into an <guilabel>Audible Bell</guilabel> section and "
"a <guilabel>Visible Bell</guilabel> section."
msgstr ""
"अयं पटलः <guilabel>श्रव्यघण्टा</guilabel> विभागः <guilabel>दृश्यघण्टी</guilabel> "
"विभागः च विभक्तः अस्ति ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The top check box labeled <guilabel>Use System Bell</guilabel>, determines "
"whether the normal System bell rings. If this option is disabled, the System "
"bell will be silenced."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Use System Bell</guilabel> इति लेबलयुक्तं उपरितनं चेकबॉक्सं, सामान्यं System "
"bell ध्वनिं करोति वा इति निर्धारयति । यदि एषः विकल्पः अक्षमः भवति तर्हि System "
"bell मौनम् भविष्यति ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next check box down can be used to play a different sound whenever the "
"system bell is triggered. To activate, place a mark in the check box labeled "
"<guilabel>Use customized bell</guilabel>, and enter the complete pathname to "
"the sound file in the text box labeled <guilabel>Sound to play</guilabel>. "
"If you want, you can select the <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> button to "
"navigate through your filesystem to find the exact file."
msgstr ""
"अग्रिमस्य चेक् बॉक्स् down इत्यस्य उपयोगेन यदा कदापि सिस्टम् बेल् प्रवर्तते तदा भिन्नं ध्वनिं "
"वादयितुं शक्यते । सक्रियीकरणार्थं <guilabel>अनुकूलितघण्टायाः उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु</guilabel> "
"इति लेबलयुक्ते चेकबॉक्स् मध्ये चिह्नं स्थापयन्तु, <guilabel>वादयितुं ध्वनिः</guilabel> इति "
"लेबलयुक्ते पाठपेटिकायां ध्वनिसञ्चिकायाः सम्पूर्णं मार्गनाम प्रविशन्तु यदि भवान् इच्छति तर्हि "
"सटीकसञ्चिकां अन्वेष्टुं स्वस्य सञ्चिकातन्त्रेण गन्तुं <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> इति बटनं "
"चिन्वतु ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For those users who have difficulty hearing the System bell, or those users "
"who have a silent computer, &kde; offers the <emphasis>visual bell</"
"emphasis>. This provides a visual signal (inverting the screen or flashing a "
"color across it) when the system bell would normally sound."
msgstr ""
"येषां उपयोक्तृणां कृते System bell श्रवणं कष्टं भवति, अथवा येषां उपयोक्तृणां मौनसङ्गणकं भवति, "
"&kde; <emphasis>दृश्यघण्टा</emphasis>ं समर्पयति । एतेन दृश्यसंकेतं (पर्दे विपर्ययितुं वा तस्य "
"पारं वर्णं ज्वलनं वा) प्राप्यते यदा सामान्यतया प्रणालीघण्टा ध्वनितवती ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use the visual bell, first place a mark in the check box labeled "
"<guilabel>Use visual bell</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"दृश्यघण्टायाः उपयोगाय प्रथमं <guilabel>दृश्यघण्टायाः उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु</guilabel> इति "
"लेबलयुक्ते चेकबॉक्समध्ये चिह्नं स्थापयन्तु ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can then select between <guilabel>Invert screen</guilabel>, or "
"<guilabel>Flash screen</guilabel>. If you select <guilabel>Invert screen</"
"guilabel>, all colors on the screen will be reversed. If you choose "
"<guilabel>Flash screen</guilabel>, you can choose the color by clicking the "
"button to the right of the <guilabel>Flash screen</guilabel> selection."
msgstr ""
"ततः भवान् <guilabel>Invert screen</guilabel>, अथवा <guilabel>Flash screen</"
"guilabel> इत्येतयोः मध्ये चयनं कर्तुं शक्नोति । यदि भवान् <guilabel>Invert screen</"
"guilabel> इति चिनोति तर्हि स्क्रीनस्य सर्वे वर्णाः विपर्यस्ताः भविष्यन्ति । यदि भवान् "
"<guilabel>Flash screen</guilabel> इति चिनोति तर्हि <guilabel>Flash screen</"
"guilabel> चयनस्य दक्षिणभागे स्थितं बटनं नुत्वा वर्णं चिन्वितुं शक्नोति ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The spin box can be used to adjust the duration of the visible bell. The "
"default value is 500 msec, or half a second."
msgstr ""
"दृश्यमानस्य घण्टायाः अवधिं समायोजयितुं स्पिन-पेटिकायाः उपयोगः कर्तुं शक्यते । पूर्वनिर्धारितं "
"मूल्यं ५०० एमएसईसी, अथवा अर्धसेकेण्ड् अस्ति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modifier keys"
msgstr "संशोधक कील"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are the two sections <guilabel>Sticky Keys</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Locking Keys</guilabel> to this panel."
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् पटलस्य <guilabel>Sticky Keys</guilabel> तथा <guilabel>Locking Keys</"
"guilabel> इति विभागद्वयम् अस्ति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use Sticky Keys"
msgstr "चिपचिपा कुञ्जीनां उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, you can press and release the &Shift;, &Alt; or "
"&Ctrl; keys, and then press another key to get a key combo (example: "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;&Del;</keycombo> could be done with "
"&Ctrl;, then &Alt; and then &Del;)."
msgstr ""
"यदि एषः विकल्पः सक्षमः अस्ति तर्हि भवान् &Shift;, &Alt; अथवा &Ctrl; कीलानि, ततः "
"कीलसंयोजनं प्राप्तुं अन्यं कीलं नुदन्तु (उदाहरणम्: <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Alt;"
"&Del;</keycombo> &Ctrl;, ततः &Alt; ततः &Del; इत्यनेन सह कर्तुं शक्यते स्म) ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also in this section is a check box labeled <guilabel>Lock Sticky Keys</"
"guilabel>. If this check box is enabled, the &Alt;, &Ctrl; and &Shift; keys "
"stay <quote>selected</quote> until you <quote>de-selected</quote> them."
msgstr ""
"अस्मिन् खण्डे अपि <guilabel>Lock Sticky Keys</guilabel> इति लेबलयुक्तं चेकबॉक्स् अस्ति । "
"यदि एतत् चेकबॉक्सं सक्षमं भवति तर्हि &Alt;, &Ctrl; तथा &Shift; कीलानि "
"<quote>चयनितानि</quote> यावत् भवन्तः तान् <quote>चयनं न कुर्वन्ति</quote> तावत् "
"तिष्ठन्ति ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid "As an example:"
msgstr "उदाहरणरूपेण :"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid "With <guilabel>Lock Sticky Keys</guilabel> disabled:"
msgstr "<guilabel>Lock Sticky Keys</guilabel> अक्षमम् अस्ति:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you press the &Shift; key then press the <keycap>F</keycap> key, the "
"computer interprets this as <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>F</"
"keycap></keycombo>. Now if you type a <keycap>P</keycap>, the computer "
"interprets this as the letter p (no shift)."
msgstr ""
"यदि भवान् &Shift; कीलं ततः <keycap>F</keycap> कीलम् नुदन्तु, सङ्गणकः एतस्य व्याख्यां "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo> इति करोति । "
"इदानीं यदि भवान् <keycap>P</keycap> इति टङ्कयति तर्हि सङ्गणकः एतत् p अक्षरम् (no "
"shift) इति व्याख्यायते ।"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "With <guilabel>Lock Sticky Keys</guilabel> enabled:"
msgstr "<guilabel>Lock Sticky Keys</guilabel> सक्षमीकरणेन सह:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you press the &Shift; key <emphasis>twice</emphasis> then press the "
"<keycap>F</keycap> key, the computer interprets this as <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo>. Now if you type a <keycap>P</"
"keycap>, the computer interprets this as the letter P (<keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>). To de-select the &Shift; "
"key, press it again."
msgstr ""
"यदि भवान् &Shift; कीलम् <emphasis>द्विवारं</emphasis> ततः <keycap>F</keycap> "
"कीलम् नुदन्तु, सङ्गणकः एतस्य व्याख्यां <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>F</"
"keycap></keycombo> इति करोति । इदानीं यदि भवान् <keycap>P</keycap> इति टङ्कयति "
"तर्हि सङ्गणकः एतत् P अक्षरम् (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Shift;<keycap>P</"
"keycap></keycombo>) इति व्याख्यायते । &Shift; कीलं, पुनः नुदन्तु।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keyboard Filters"
msgstr "कीबोर्ड फ़िल्टर"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:389 index.docbook:496
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two sections to this panel."
msgstr "अस्य पटलस्य द्वौ विभागौ स्तः ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use slow keys"
msgstr "मन्दकीलानां उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, you must hold the key down for a specified length "
"of time (adjustable with the spin box) before the keystroke will be "
"accepted. This helps prevent accidental key strokes."
msgstr ""
"यदि एषः विकल्पः सक्षमः अस्ति तर्हि कीलप्रहारस्य स्वीकारात् पूर्वं भवद्भिः कीलं निर्दिष्टकालं "
"यावत् (स्पिन् बॉक्सेन सह समायोज्यम्) अधः धारयितव्यम् । एतेन आकस्मिकं कीलप्रहारं निवारयितुं "
"साहाय्यं भवति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use bounce keys"
msgstr "बाउन्स कीलस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, you must wait for a specified length of time "
"(configurable with the spin box) before the next key press can be accepted. "
"This prevents accidental multiple key strokes."
msgstr ""
"यदि एषः विकल्पः सक्षमः अस्ति तर्हि अग्रिमस्य कील-दबावस्य स्वीकारात् पूर्वं निर्दिष्टं समयं "
"(स्पिन्-बॉक्सेन सह विन्यासयोग्यं) प्रतीक्षितव्यम् । एतेन आकस्मिकं बहुविधं कीलप्रहारं निवारितं "
"भवति ।"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse Navigation"
msgstr "मूषक नेविगेशन"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab allows you to configure the keyboard number pad keys as a mouse-"
"type device. This may be useful when you are working on a device without "
"another pointing device, or where you have no other use for the number pad."
msgstr ""
"एतत् ट्याब् भवन्तं कीबोर्डसङ्ख्यापैड् कीलानि मूषकप्रकारस्य यन्त्ररूपेण विन्यस्तुं शक्नोति । यदा "
"भवान् अन्यं सूचकयन्त्रं विना यन्त्रे कार्यं करोति, अथवा यत्र भवतां संख्यापट्टिकायाः अन्यः "
"उपयोगः नास्ति तदा एतत् उपयोगी भवितुम् अर्हति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "Move pointer with keyboard (using the num pad)"
msgstr "कीबोर्डेन सह सूचकं चालयन्तु (num pad इत्यस्य उपयोगेन)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enable keyboard mouse mode, you need to select the check box labeled "
"<guilabel>Move pointer with keyboard (using the num pad)</guilabel>. When "
"you do this, the other settings will become enabled, and you can customize "
"the keyboard pointer behavior further, if required."
msgstr ""
"कीबोर्डमूषकविधानं सक्षमं कर्तुं भवद्भिः <guilabel>कीबोर्डेन सह सूचकं चालयन्तु (num pad "
"इत्यस्य उपयोगेन)</guilabel> इति लेबलयुक्तं चेकबॉक्सं चिन्वन्तु । यदा भवान् एतत् करोति तदा "
"अन्ये सेटिङ्ग्स् सक्षमाः भविष्यन्ति, अपि च भवान् कीबोर्ड-सूचक-व्यवहारं अधिकं अनुकूलितुं शक्नोति, "
"यदि आवश्यकं भवति ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:438
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The various keys on the number pad move in the direction you would expect. "
"Note that you can move diagonally as well as up, down, left and right. The "
"<keycap>5</keycap> key emulates a click to a pointer button, typically "
"&LMB;. You change which button is emulated by using the <keycap>/</keycap> "
"key (which makes it &LMB;), <keycap>*</keycap> key (which makes it &MMB;) "
"and <keycap>-</keycap> (which makes it &RMB;). Using the <keycap>+</keycap> "
"emulates a double click to the selected pointer button. You can use the "
"<keycap>0</keycap> key to emulate holding down the selected pointer button "
"(for easy dragging), and then use the <keycap>.</keycap> to emulate "
"releasing the selected pointer button."
msgstr ""
"नम्बरपैड् इत्यस्मिन् विविधाः कीलानि भवन्तः अपेक्षन्ते तस्याः दिशि गच्छन्ति । ध्यानं कुर्वन्तु यत् "
"भवन्तः तिर्यक् अपि च उपरि, अधः, वामम्, दक्षिणं च गन्तुं शक्नुवन्ति । <keycap>5</keycap> "
"कीलः सूचकबटनं प्रति क्लिक् अनुकरणं करोति, सामान्यतया &LMB;. भवान् <keycap>/</keycap> "
"कीलस्य (यत् &LMB; करोति), <keycap>*</keycap> कीलस्य (यत् &MMB; करोति) तथा "
"<keycap>-</keycap इत्यस्य उपयोगेन कस्य बटनस्य अनुकरणं भवति इति परिवर्तयन्ति > (यत् "
"&RMB; करोति)। <keycap>+</keycap> इत्यस्य उपयोगेन चयनितसूचकबटनं प्रति द्विवारं क्लिक् "
"अनुकरणं भवति । चयनितं सूचकबटनं धारयितुं (सुलभकर्षणार्थं) अनुकरणार्थं <keycap>0</keycap> "
"कीलस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नुवन्ति, ततः चयनितसूचकबटनस्य मुक्तिं अनुकरणार्थं <keycap>.</keycap> "
"इत्यस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नुवन्ति"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid "Acceleration delay"
msgstr "त्वरणविलम्बः"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the time (in milliseconds) between the initial key press and the "
"first repeated motion event for mouse key acceleration."
msgstr ""
"एषः मूषककुंजीत्वरणार्थं प्रारम्भिककीलदबावस्य प्रथमपुनरावृत्तिगतिघटनायाः च मध्ये समयः "
"(मिलिसेकेण्ड्-मात्रायां) अस्ति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid "Repeat interval"
msgstr "अन्तरालं पुनः कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the time in milliseconds between repeated motion events for mouse "
"key acceleration."
msgstr "एषः मूषककुंजीत्वरणार्थं पुनरावृत्तिगतिघटनानां मध्ये मिलीसेकेण्ड्-मात्रायां समयः अस्ति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:463
#, no-c-format
msgid "Acceleration time"
msgstr "त्वरणकालः"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the time in milliseconds before the pointer reaches a maximum speed "
"for mouse key acceleration."
msgstr "मूषककुंजीत्वरणार्थं सूचकः अधिकतमवेगं प्राप्तुं पूर्वं मिलीसेकेण्ड्-मात्रायां एषः समयः भवति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:472
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum speed"
msgstr "अधिकतम गति"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:474
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the maximum speed in pixels per second the pointer can reach for "
"mouse key acceleration."
msgstr "एषः अधिकतमः वेगः प्रति सेकण्ड् पिक्सेलरूपेण सूचकः मूषककुंजीत्वरणार्थं प्राप्तुं शक्नोति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pointer acceleration"
msgstr "सूचकत्वरणम्"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:483
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is the amount of acceleration to apply to mouse key acceleration."
msgstr "इदं मूषककुंजीत्वरणे प्रयोक्तुं त्वरणस्य परिमाणम् अस्ति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:494
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Activation Gestures"
msgid "Activation Shortcuts"
msgstr "सक्रियण इशारे"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:500
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Activation Gestures</guilabel> with these options:"
msgstr "<guilabel>सक्रियता-इशाराः</guilabel> एतैः विकल्पैः सह:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:504
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use gestures for activating sticky keys and slow keys"
msgstr "चिपचिपानां कीलानां, मन्दकीलानां च सक्रियीकरणाय इशाराणां उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following features:"
msgstr ""
"अत्र भवान् कीबोर्ड-इशाराणि सक्रियं कर्तुं शक्नोति यत् निम्नलिखित-विशेषताः चालू करोति ।"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mouse Keys: Press &Shift;+NumLock"
msgstr "माउस कील: &Shift;+NumLock नुदन्तु"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sticky keys: Press &Shift; key 5 consecutive times"
msgstr "चिपचिपाः कीलानि: &Shift; कील ५ क्रमशः वार"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "Slow keys: Hold down &Shift; for 8 seconds"
msgstr "मन्दकुंजी: &Shift; ८ सेकण्ड् यावत्"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid "Turn sticky keys and slow keys off after a certain period of inactivity"
msgstr ""
"निष्क्रियतायाः निश्चितकालस्य अनन्तरं चिपचिपाः कीलानि, मन्दकीलानि च निष्क्रियं कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:516
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Notification</guilabel> with these options:"
msgstr "<guilabel>सूचना</guilabel> एतैः विकल्पैः सह:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:520
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the system bell whenever a gesture is used to turn an accessibility "
"feature on or off"
msgstr ""
"यदा कदापि सुलभताविशेषतां चालू वा निष्क्रियं वा कर्तुं इशारस्य उपयोगः भवति तदा "
"प्रणालीघण्टायाः उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:523
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Show a confirmation dialog whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is "
"turned on or off"
msgstr ""
"यदा कदापि कीबोर्ड-सुलभता-विशेषता चालू अथवा निष्क्रियं भवति तदा पुष्टिकरण-संवादं दर्शयतु"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, &kde; will show a confirmation dialog whenever a "
"keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off."
msgstr ""
"यदि एषः विकल्पः परीक्षितः अस्ति, &kde; यदा कदापि कीबोर्ड-सुलभता-विशेषता चालू अथवा "
"निष्क्रियं भवति तदा पुष्टिकरण-संवादं दर्शयिष्यति ।"

#. Tag: member
#: index.docbook:527
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ensure you know what you are doing if you uncheck it, as the keyboard "
"accessibility settings will then always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""
"यदि भवान् तत् अनचेक् करोति तर्हि भवान् किं करोति इति जानाति इति सुनिश्चितं कुर्वन्तु, यतः "
"तदा कीबोर्ड-सुलभता-सेटिंग्स् सर्वदा पुष्टिं विना प्रयुक्ताः भविष्यन्ति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:530
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use &kde;'s system notification mechanism whenever a keyboard accessibility "
"feature is turned on or off"
msgstr ""
"यदा कदापि कीबोर्ड-सुलभता-विशेषता चालू अथवा निष्क्रियं भवति तदा &kde;-इत्यस्य प्रणाली-"
"सूचना-तन्त्रस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:537
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Configure Notifications</guibutton> button to open a "
"dialog which allows you to edit the notifications for status changes of all "
"keys."
msgstr ""
"संवादं उद्घाटयितुं <guibutton>सूचनाः विन्यस्य</guibutton> बटनं नुदन्तु यत् सर्वेषां कीलानां "
"स्थितिपरिवर्तनार्थं सूचनाः सम्पादयितुं शक्नोति ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:543
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screen Reader"
msgstr "स्क्रीन रीडर"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:545
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install a screen reader application like <ulink url=\"https://en.wikipedia."
"org/wiki/Orca_(assistive_technology)\">Orca</ulink> together with "
"<application>speech-dispatcher</application>."
msgstr ""
"<ulink url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Orca_(assistive_technology)\">Orca</ulink> इत्यादिं स्क्रीनरीडर-अनुप्रयोगं "
"<application>speech-dispatcher</application> इत्यनेन सह संस्थापनं कुर्वन्तु ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Test that sound from speech dispatcher works using the command <command>spd-"
"say hello</command> in a terminal."
msgstr ""
"टर्मिनल् मध्ये <command>spd-say hello</command> इति आदेशस्य उपयोगेन स्पीच् डिस्पैचरतः "
"ध्वनिः कार्यं करोति इति परीक्ष्यताम् ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition you need a text to speech synthesizer like &eg; "
"<application>espeak</application>."
msgstr "तदतिरिक्तं भवतः &eg; <अनुप्रयोग>भाषते</application> ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:557
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable the screen reader in the checkbox, logout and restart your desktop "
"session."
msgstr ""
"चेकबॉक्स मध्ये स्क्रीन रीडर सक्षमं कुर्वन्तु, लॉगआउट् कृत्वा स्वस्य डेस्कटॉप् सत्रं पुनः आरभत ।"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:560
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For &plasma; itself, make sure to use the traditional <guilabel>Application "
"Menu</guilabel>, and check that this menu has a keyboard shortcut associated "
"(<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F1</keycap></keycombo>). When "
"pressing this shortcut, the menu should open and be read when navigating the "
"menu with the arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"& प्लाज्मा; स्वयं, पारम्परिकं <guilabel>अनुप्रयोगमेनू</guilabel> इत्यस्य उपयोगं सुनिश्चितं "
"कुर्वन्तु, तथा च पश्यन्तु यत् अस्मिन् मेन्यू इत्यस्य कीबोर्डशॉर्टकट् सम्बद्धः अस्ति (<keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>F1</keycap></keycombo >). एतत् शॉर्टकट् नुदन्ते सति "
"मेन्यू उद्घाटितं भवेत्, बाणकुंजीभिः मेनू नेविगेट् करणसमये पठनीयं च ।"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:569
#, no-c-format
msgid "Color Blindness Correction"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is an accessibility tool designed to help users with color vision "
"deficiencies better distinguish between colors on their screen."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:574
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Unlike simple filters that change the <quote>look</quote> of the desktop, "
"this feature uses <ulink url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color_blindness"
"\">daltonization algorithms</ulink>. These algorithms shift problematic "
"color frequencies into parts of the spectrum that the user can see more "
"clearly, helping to restore contrast that would otherwise be lost."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main objectives:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:582
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many interfaces use color to convey meaning (&eg;, green for <quote>success</"
"quote> and red for <quote>error</quote>). For someone with protanopia or "
"deuteranopia, these may look identical. The correction pane shifts these "
"colors so the distinction becomes visible."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:587
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It ensures that buttons, graphs, and highlighted text are legible, "
"regardless of the original design's color palette."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:592
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because it is handled at the compositor level (&kwin;), the correction "
"applies to everything—web browsers, specialized engineering software, "
"videos, and the desktop interface itself."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The pane typically offers adjustments for the three primary types of color "
"blindness:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid "Protanopia: Red-blindness (difficulty seeing red light)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:607
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deuteranopia: Green-blindness (the most common form)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:612
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tritanopia: Blue-blindness (rarer, difficulty distinguishing blue and "
"yellow)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Problematic colors</guilabel> selection: You select the "
"specific type of deficiency."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:620
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Intensity</guilabel> slider: This is the most important part "
"of the pane. It allows you to adjust the strength of the shift. Since color "
"vision is a spectrum, a \"one size fits all\" filter rarely works; the "
"slider lets you fine-tune the correction to your specific vision."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:624
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These filters are intended for accessibility, not for color-accurate work "
"like professional photo editing or digital painting. Because they shift the "
"color spectrum to make it \"readable,\" the colors on the screen will no "
"longer match the \"true\" hex codes or print values of the files you are "
"viewing."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can control the results using <guilabel>Adjusted colors</guilabel> "
"swatches."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:634
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This pane configures a tool to flip the color values of your screen—turning "
"white pixels to black, blues to oranges, and so on. This is handled by the "
"&kwin; window manager as a post-processing effect."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While it might look like a <quote>Negative</quote> photo filter, its primary "
"purposes are functional rather than aesthetic:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For users with specific visual impairments, such as photophobia (light "
"sensitivity) or certain types of low vision, a standard bright screen can "
"cause physical pain or make text appear blurry due to <quote>light bleed.</"
"quote>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:645
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Inverting the screen turns bright backgrounds dark and dark text light, "
"significantly reducing the amount of light emitted by the monitor while "
"maintaining the contrast needed to read."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:648
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While most modern applications have native dark modes, some older software "
"or specific web pages are hard-coded with white backgrounds."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:651
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Invert tool acts as a <quote>universal dark mode.</quote> If an "
"application doesn't support a dark theme, you can force the colors to invert "
"to save your eyes during late-night work sessions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:654
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can switch on the inversion using the <guilabel>Invert</guilabel> "
"checkbox and <guibutton>Configure Shortcuts...</guibutton> for this action."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:660
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shake Pointer"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:662
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the &plasma; desktop environment, the <guilabel>Shake Pointer</guilabel> "
"(often colloquially called \"Shake to Find\") is an accessibility and "
"productivity feature designed to solve the \"lost cursor\" problem."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:665
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are using a multi-monitor setup, an ultra-high-resolution display, or "
"simply have a dark wallpaper, it is remarkably easy to lose track of where "
"the mouse cursor is. The purpose of this feature is to provide an immediate "
"visual clue to help you locate it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:668
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When the feature is enabled, the system monitors the velocity and direction "
"of mouse movements. If it detects a rapid back-and-forth \"shaking\" motion:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:673
#, no-c-format
msgid "Temporary enlargement: The cursor increases in size to the large scale."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:678
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Visual focus: This sudden change in scale catches the human eye’s peripheral "
"vision, instantly revealing the cursor's coordinates."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Automatic reset: As soon as you stop shaking the mouse, the cursor shrinks "
"back to its normal size."
msgstr ""

